{title: El Gozo de Dios}
{artist: The Belonging Co}
{composer: Andrew Holt, Mitch Wong}
{key: Db}
{source: https://www.worshiptogether.com/es/canciones/el-gozo-de-dios-the-belonging-co/}
{source: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2t34jEhRhiQ | YouTube}
{bpm: 132}
{duration_ms: 330000}

{start_of_intro}
[Db]   [Dbsus/Eb]   [Db/Gb]   [Db/Gb]
{comment: Repeat intro 3x}
{end_of_intro}

{start_of_verse: Verso 1}
[Db]
Hoy yo me alegraré
[Db]              [Bm7]
En el día que hiciste tú
    [Gb2]              [Db]
Que hiciste tú, Señor
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verso 2}
[Db]
Hoy yo decido creer
         [Bm7]
Más que suficiente eres tú
    [Gb2]              [Db]
Por siempre declararé
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_pre-chorus: Pre-Coro}
[Gb]
Tu eres Fiel a tus promesas
     [Ab]              [Db]
Fuerte cuando debil soy
[Gb]
Al estar en tu presencia
     [Ab]
Yo con todo cantaré
{end_of_pre-chorus}

{start_of_chorus: Coro}
[Db]
El gozo De Dios
     [Dbsus/Eb]              [Db/Gb]
El gozo de Dios fuerza es
[Db/Gb]
El gozo De Dios
     [Dbsus/Eb]              [Db/Gb]
El gozo de Dios fuerza es
[Db/Gb]
     [Bbm7]    [Ab]
Mi alma te cantará
[Db/F]              [Ebm7]
Todo en mi proclamará
[Db]              [Dbsus/Eb]              [Db/Gb]   [Db]
Que el gozo de Dios El gozo de Dios fuerza es
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_interlude}
[Db]   [Dbsus/Eb]   [Db/Gb]   [Db/Gb]
[Db]   [Dbsus/Eb]   [Db/Gb]   [Db/Gb]
{end_of_interlude}

{start_of_verse: Verso 3}
[Db]
Cristo, sea tú voluntad
         [Bm7]
Digno de gloria y honor
    [Gb2]              [Db]
Gloria y Honor, Señor
{end_of_verse}

